  "finalText": "I added a testimonials section after Features. It has a \"Loved by product teams\" heading and three quote cards. Each card has a quote, a round avatar placeholder, a name and a company. The cards use the same surface, radius and padding as the feature cards. They show in one column on mobile and three columns from the medium breakpoint up. Lint flagged the avatar sizes as literal values, so I switched them to the `space.12` token.\n\nThe quotes, names and companies are placeholder text. The names are Maya Chen (Northwind), Daniel Okafor (Lumen Labs) and Priya Raman (Orbit Systems).",
